{
 "flograph_version": "0.1.31",
 "schema": 1,
 "graph": {
  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "t39_intro",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     -300
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "# Status cards\nSix small cards for the top of a dashboard. Each one is a self-contained page,\nso it looks the same on the canvas, in a tile, in a report and in a browser.\nEdit the two tables and watch them follow — then open the **Overview** page.",
     "width": 1000,
     "height": 180
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_sales",
    "type": "flograph.io.table",
    "pos": [
     0,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "data": "{\"version\": 2, \"columns\": [{\"name\": \"month\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"revenue\", \"type\": \"number\"}], \"rows\": [[\"2026-01\", 18200], [\"2026-02\", 19100], [\"2026-03\", 18800], [\"2026-04\", 20400], [\"2026-05\", 21900], [\"2026-06\", 21300], [\"2026-07\", 23800], [\"2026-08\", 24600], [\"2026-09\", 26100]]}",
     "width": 320,
     "height": 300
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Monthly sales"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_n_spark",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     400
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**Sparkline Card** — the big number plus the line under it; *Order by* a\ndate so it reads left to right. **Card** (built in) picks January out so\nthe cards to the right can compare against it.",
     "width": 320,
     "height": 160
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_spark",
    "type": "flograph.viz.sparkline_card",
    "pos": [
     560,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "column": "revenue",
     "aggregation": "Last",
     "order_by": "month",
     "label": "Revenue this month",
     "format": "$,.0f",
     "width": 260,
     "height": 160
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_first",
    "type": "flograph.viz.card",
    "pos": [
     560,
     240
    ],
    "params": {
     "column": "revenue",
     "aggregation": "First",
     "label": "January",
     "format": "$,.0f"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "January revenue"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_goal",
    "type": "flograph.viz.goal_card",
    "pos": [
     1000,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "label": "Revenue",
     "comparison_label": "January",
     "format": "$,.0f",
     "width": 260,
     "height": 140
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Goal Card (change)"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_goal_prog",
    "type": "flograph.viz.goal_card",
    "pos": [
     1000,
     200
    ],
    "params": {
     "label": "Target $30k",
     "mode": "progress",
     "target": 30000,
     "comparison_label": "target",
     "format": "$,.0f",
     "width": 260,
     "height": 140
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Goal Card (progress)"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_summary",
    "type": "flograph.viz.plain_english_summary",
    "pos": [
     1000,
     420
    ],
    "params": {
     "template": "Revenue {value}, {direction} {change} since January",
     "value_format": "$,.0f",
     "width": 400,
     "height": 100
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_n_goal",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1460,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**Goal Card** compares one number with another: as a change with an arrow,\nor as progress towards a target. Untick *Higher is better* for costs.\n\n**Plain-English Summary** writes the headline from the same two numbers.",
     "width": 360,
     "height": 200
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_invoices",
    "type": "flograph.io.table",
    "pos": [
     0,
     800
    ],
    "params": {
     "data": "{\"version\": 2, \"columns\": [{\"name\": \"invoice\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"customer\", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"name\": \"days_overdue\", \"type\": \"integer\"}, {\"name\": \"amount\", \"type\": \"number\"}], \"rows\": [[\"INV-104\", \"Acme\", 45, 1200], [\"INV-118\", \"Umbrella\", 12, 640], [\"INV-131\", \"Globex\", 38, 860], [\"INV-140\", \"Initech\", 31, 4300], [\"INV-152\", \"Hooli\", 3, 220]]}",
     "width": 420,
     "height": 220
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Invoices"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_overdue",
    "type": "flograph.transform.filter_rows",
    "pos": [
     560,
     860
    ],
    "params": {
     "query": "days_overdue > 30"
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "Over 30 days"
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_alerts",
    "type": "flograph.viz.alert_list",
    "pos": [
     800,
     800
    ],
    "params": {
     "title": "Overdue invoices",
     "message": "{invoice} · {customer} · {days_overdue} days · {amount:$,.0f}",
     "width": 360,
     "height": 220
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_light",
    "type": "flograph.viz.status_light",
    "pos": [
     1280,
     800
    ],
    "params": {
     "label": "Overdue invoices",
     "amber": 1,
     "red": 3,
     "width": 240,
     "height": 110
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_asof",
    "type": "flograph.util.as_of_stamp",
    "pos": [
     1280,
     1040
    ],
    "params": {
     "stale_minutes": 60,
     "width": 240,
     "height": 60
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "t39_n_alerts",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     1120
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**Alert List** shows whatever reaches it — decide what counts as an alert\nwith a **Filter Rows** in front. Its **count** lights the **Status Light**\n(amber at 1, red at 3). **As-of Stamp** says when the invoices last ran,\nand turns amber after an hour.",
     "width": 600,
     "height": 160
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   }
